title: "Agent Defense Radar"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Nakatsugawa
    given-names: Masahiro
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3224-0103"
abstract: >-
  A defensive visualization of indirect prompt injection against LLM agents (Japanese and English):
  attention, surprisal and actual outputs recorded from a real model (LLM-jp-4.1-8B-thinking, 4-bit MLX)
  with and without a guard prompt, plus a live test of the user's own OpenAI-compatible model.
